  "description": "Human greed is endless, and we repeat the same mistakes...? We're opening up reviews of the truly great items you'll want to use for a lifetime, and the truly bad items you'll want to immediately return. We're sharing the stories of characters in the works and the whirlwind impulse purchases of our writers!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Stories Included:*\n1. **Kwinpaemilli(nim)ui Jeonhwareul Badeusigetseumnikka?** (퀸패밀리(님)의 전화를 받으시겠습니까?) \\[Beombae\\]\n2. **Ppalgan Jjoljjori** (빨간 쫄쫄이) \\[Ssapcho\\]\n3. **Chungdonggumaega Hyodoreul Sitgo** (충동구매가 효도를 싣고) \\[Hod Kim\\]\n4. **Sarangui Gumae - Huimangpyeon** (사랑의 구매 - 희망편) \\[Song-A Min\\]\n5. **Geureol Sudo Itji.** (그럴 수도 있지.) \\[Rangddo\\]\n6. **Taekbaega Jalsantem** (택배가 잘산템) \\[HENIE\\]\n7. **Yo Geullae Naega Jeil Jal San Kkultem!** (요 근래 내가 제일 잘 산 꿀템!) \\[Kkom-Ji Eun\\]\n8. **Goyangi** (고양이) \\[Massstar\\]\n9. **Maeummeokgie Ttara** (마음먹기에 따라) \\[Hongkki\\]\n10. **Ppallae Insaeng 2-hoecha Injeong?** (빨래 인생 2회차 인정?) \\[Seong-Dae Oh\\]\n11. **Jangnankeuaam** (장난크아암) \\[Hiphop Sinsun\\]\n12. **Jalsantem Sogeumchong** (잘산템 소금총) \\[Cutbu\\]\n13. **Yeonghoni Bakkwineun Bujeogeul Satda!** (영혼이 바뀌는 부적을 샀다!) \\[Yoen\\]\n14. **Saengjon Diet** (생존 다이어트) \\[Gyaoo\\]\n15. **Dokgeonochonggagui Got'em!** (독거노총각의 갓템!) \\[Kun-Seu Seo\\]\n16. **Jeonseorui Jakga Sansamui Geumdanjiseo Jingwibon!** (전설의 작가 산삼의 금단지서 진귀본!) \\[Sansam\\]\n17. **Han Yi-Yeon-ui Chungdonggumae Huimangpyeon** (한이연의 충동구매 희망편) \\[Eun-Jae Lee\\]\n18. **Nae Kkumeun Neoya.. Subak-Ka.** (내 꿈은 너야..수박카.) \\[Lady Watermelon\\]",
